  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115560",
      "title": "Using Content Projection & ng-content",
      "lectureOrder": 103,
      "videoOrder": 97,
      "sourceHash": "95a08841f19965e7ddacb90d2f584073db2b9cdeb93c975f1c703a5de2c68be7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 3.78,
          "en": "So, why is the actual Component content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.78,
          "end": 5.58,
          "en": "missing here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.58,
          "end": 9.3,
          "en": "I mean, in our app Component HTML file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.3,
          "end": 13.44,
          "en": "we are still outputting those specific Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.44,
          "end": 15.783,
          "en": "between the app dashboard item tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.19,
          "end": 19.53,
          "en": "And that is correct, we are doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.53,
          "end": 23.4,
          "en": "But by default, if you are building a custom component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.4,
          "end": 27.81,
          "en": "Angular ignores any content you have between the opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.81,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "and closing tags of that custom Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 35.1,
          "en": "And it ignores the content between those tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.1,
          "end": 37.65,
          "en": "because it wouldn't know where to put it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.65,
          "end": 41.22,
          "en": "I mean, in the dashboard item template here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.22,
          "end": 45.54,
          "en": "I am not telling Angular where to render any content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.54,
          "end": 48.03,
          "en": "that is put between those tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.03,
          "end": 50.4,
          "en": "So how would it know where to place it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.4,
          "end": 51.773,
          "en": "In front of that div?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 51.773,
          "end": 53.64,
          "en": "Inside of that div?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.64,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "After the div? Instead of the div?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 58.32,
          "en": "Angular doesn't know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.32,
          "end": 63.06,
          "en": "So we need to tell Angular where to put any wrapped content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.06,
          "end": 66.72,
          "en": "And we do that with help of a special instruction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 66.72,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "you can add to your Angular templates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 74.19,
          "en": "The NG content instruction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.19,
          "end": 76.41,
          "en": "It's essentially an HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 79.53,
          "en": "a nonstandard HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.53,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "which is understood by Angular though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 85.17,
          "en": "which you place in your templates to tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.17,
          "end": 89.61,
          "en": "that it should render any wrapped content in that place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.61,
          "end": 92.72999999999999,
          "en": "So NG content is essentially a placeholder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.72999999999999,
          "end": 95.642,
          "en": "for any wrapped content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.642,
          "end": 99.24000000000001,
          "en": "And therefore with that added, if we saved it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.24000000000001,
          "end": 101.58,
          "en": "now our actual content is back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.58,
          "end": 104.55,
          "en": "though, now I have some duplication here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.55,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "because of course I still have that title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "and that image in my Components here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 113.523,
          "en": "in my service status and so on Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.99000000000001,
          "end": 119.43,
          "en": "And therefore we should now clean up those Components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.43,
          "end": 123.33,
          "en": "because now that we added the dashboard item, the article",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.33,
          "end": 128.33,
          "en": "and header are shared through that dashboard item Component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.37,
          "end": 130.44,
          "en": "So in the server status Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 131.67,
          "en": "and the other Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.67,
          "end": 134.523,
          "en": "we should no longer have this article and header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.42,
          "end": 138.54,
          "en": "Instead here, we should now really only have that div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.54,
          "end": 141.333,
          "en": "that holds the actual component content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.74,
          "end": 146.13,
          "en": "And I'll do that here for the server status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.13,
          "end": 149.4,
          "en": "For the tickets, I'll get rid of article at header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.4,
          "end": 152.043,
          "en": "and all of the closing article element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.18,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "and I'll do it for the traffic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 157.62,
          "en": "get rid of article and header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.62,
          "end": 161.94299999999998,
          "en": "and of the closing article, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.29,
          "end": 166.89,
          "en": "Well, and with that, now this looks fine again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.89,
          "end": 169.07999999999998,
          "en": "but now we're rendering this with help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.07999999999998,
          "end": 172.14600000000002,
          "en": "of another reusable component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 172.14600000000002,
          "end": 176.19299999999998,
          "en": "the dashboard item component, which we added here.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
